    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "posfrom": "0,-150",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "With a clatter, a can falls out from his coat, which he hastily stoops to pick back up and hide again under his layers."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, that's our last can of meat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, I can't carry on. I'm at my limit! This lockdown zone, the dust of the dead floating in the air, this rotting corpse stench, this\u2014everything\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't understand! Why should I be living out my days like this?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm someone who means something! I should be waking up to the call of fowl, to a cup of coffee, and then to my writing desk and manuscripts...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why should I\u2014madams, I'm sorry, I'm aware of all the assistance you've afforded me, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me, really, please, but this isn't the sort of thing I should be doing. I used to take pride in my virtue\u2014I was wonderful to my servants, I would tip double what anyone else would whenever we went out to eat...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't carry on. I've had enough, really. I just can't make sense of this, I'm so confused...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you're free to put down that can you've got, and be out of this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can make a trade with you! I have some gems, Sargon origin, and a Sankta's patron firearm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which we don't need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm begging you, I'm begging you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "0,-50",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The man trembles and shakes harder and harder, until finally his legs give out and he's kneeling on the floor. He's probably never begged someone like this in all his life. He's acting a comedic sight."
    },
    {
        "text": "He grips his overcoat with white knuckles, so tight the place where he hides the can bulges out. It's like a weeping tumor parasiting off his body. Or an unborn child more loved than it'd ever know."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get on your way, man. Front door's sealed. You know how to make a balcony exit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let him go, let him go! Get him the hell out of here, and that stupid bloody can with him! Never to return, why don't you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm worn. I'm done watching this happen anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never want to see... any of this anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "posfrom": "0,-50",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The timid man hurries to leave, stumbling, hesitating, like he doesn't believe this boxing gym owner-slash-gang member would let him go so easy."
    },
    {
        "text": "Delphine stares daggers at him. He turned his head, and subconsciously he feels about himself. He doesn't have a thing on him. Notes and coins are worse than useless in Norport these days, to boot."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_chess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "300,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He grinds his teeth, drops down and leaves that gussied-up pen of his on the floor, then immediately turns and legs it into the darkness."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#6$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-50",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Baird picks the fountain pen up, and with no comment stows it in her pocket."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Delphine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_863_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come and let's touch heads. Kip for a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like the old days, in the video shop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Baird"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
