    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Young girl. They say you're the merc freshly assigned here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y... Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nice luck, then. You've got an easy job here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "All you've gotta do is watch that those Victorian guys don't cross the blockade line. If anyone makes trouble, you kill 'em.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha! Yeah, let's give those stuck-up Victorians the miserable days they deserve! If I was calling shots, I'd throw them a pile of hatchets or whatever and let them dispatch themselves instead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't think the brief allows that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know how to rain on a parade, little girl. We're Sarkaz. What does it matter to us if they live or die?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "We may as well find our own fun where we can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "B... But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, whatever. I'm going to take a nap, so you watch this place. If any accidents happen, I've got no reservations about taking your little head off along with theirs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
