    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#11$1",
        "posfrom": "300,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't bring much out this time. There's some food, and some medicine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that suffices, thank you, thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is it so weird for me to help you? You're a Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're one of us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if we talk to my officer, sir? You don't need to be staying with these Victorians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no. I've lived here my whole life. This is my home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Londinium is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyplace you go, you find Sarkaz, don't you? I took on running a hotel myself, after you lot arrived here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never been to Kazdel, little girl. Is that where you're from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I've never been either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then where do you call home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#15$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Home? I... I'm not that sure. I was born in Columbia, but... my old captain said Kazdel was the real home for us Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though you've never set foot there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't know, but that's what all of them say...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah-hah. I don't take much notice of what those soldiers like to tell us. Never mind going out killing with them\u2014I'd rather get that chandelier in my hotel fixed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should've seen it when it was still in good shape, I'm telling you. A crown of jewels to beat any dame's necklace!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to mention all the effort I spent as a younger man, hands-on, polishing that thing to a spit-shine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... You sure are one weird Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it strange to be more fond of light fixtures than murder? I'm sorry, I confess I've never had much contact with mercenaries...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it more than comforts me that there are kindhearted girls like you who'd bring supplies for me out here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bye for now, child. I can't stay around here too long. If you ever get the chance in future, you must come pay a visit to my hotel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forty, even thirty years ago, when Norport was still singing with life, the hotel on Sunset Street was the best place in all of Londinium to be!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#13$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe... once we're done with this war?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Paprika"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_865_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah-hah. Good! You'll have a secret invitation from me to try our best desserts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elderly Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
