    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such witchery has no purchase against us, Banshee. You've made more than enough attempts over these past days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is time wasted. A true grasp of our cluster's nature is not yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your knowledge is wholly attained from study. Altogether parched is your personal experience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps, you should lay down your pen of bone for one moment? We would like simply to take a walk with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the words of a good Viscount we once became, this city offers no better time than the present.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Walk slow. The footpaths about the city center are Londinium's pride.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damazti, what fate is it you wish to elect for yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're profuse with incarnations and transformations. You believe death is always yours to outrun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will perform your elegy, for you in your whole.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, don't look to scare us, Banshee. We know the methods at your disposal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "We simply point out that an individual's death is not the end to us, just as a city does not metamorphose for a street's removal, nor does a civilization collapse for a written script's vanishing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet any civilization will languish and decline.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And thus, we value the renewal, the experience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "We knew close to every one of your forebears, Banshee. All once were young, and all once were greatly, ardently aspirational as you are now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps there's no other way it should be. Perhaps it is by the elegy, the dirge, that transformation should be begotten.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they all became as dust in the end. Your cohort likewise cannot flee the knell at your nape.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does your experience still draw you to that flame of ruination's side?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. No, it doesn't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Already we have searched for countless years, and still we search. For different looks, for different places.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are an extraordinary master of witchcraft.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "May we bid you to grant this olden memory a pittance of a stage set?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_humanchange"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_072",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We... I sunk into Sargon's sea of sands for a hundred years. The time when the King of Kings' expedition had only just come to a close.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such exploits call to you to follow in their wake. Especially before they've fully passed into legend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Banshee, stir those sandstorms for me, a Fata Morgana though it may be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I ask a meager moment of your precious time. Come seek my origins with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let us submerse in them. Let us trek together. Maybe you'll understand me, or maybe I'll find myself in you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Prove yourself to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will reach a conclusion, Damazti.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Curtains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.3,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_magicchange",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_deserttownD",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_072"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, obviously, this doesn't quite match up with what remnant memories I have, but I can't blame you. The wind scours all too many traces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was here I built people's houses. Newfangled wonders like nomadic cities weren't yet to be, and the houses built of stones ultimately vanished into thin air within the sandstorms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Built, then destroyed, built, then destroyed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Most might tire after facing such a cycle, but in it, I was happy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You likened this to civilization. This is the 'renewal' you so enjoy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not enjoy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was a sloppy metaphor, no more. Ultimately, there is a construction to every civilization, and an ending.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "And yet I possess neither, though I so yearn to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You aren't a stone. You're sand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Banshee. I am sand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unable to be constructed. Its very own end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "A state you're not content with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I once became as a lord ameer's countenance, and met the King of Kings of that era. He proclaimed himself 'The Shah of Past and Future,' that all answers to all creation lay in his golden trove of treasures.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I asked him: Your Majesty, what meaning is there to all we surround ourselves with? Where will you lead us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "He lifted his head high, and proclaimed to me: My very thought is Meaning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such was his arrogance, his egotism, that basking in the light of the afternoon sun, he believed himself Civilization's ruler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "But all I could see was that, comically, he'd trodden on a corner of his own cloak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was bored. And so I departed the place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Sargonian'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
