    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm very struck by the dukes' methods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our squad's not a small one... but you infiltrated like you were walking into your own backyard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those quick grapples of yours, and the mini illusion Units... No wonder you got your own Londinium intelligence network established under Sarkaz control this strict.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're free enough you can move between Londinium and this disused plate however you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria's the most formidable nation in these lands, and the Duke I'm loyal to is Victoria's worthiest of note.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's only natural we'd have our whole gallery of Arts tricks readied.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Hope you don't turn them on us.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Duke of Caster treats her friends very dearly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "The airship's hidden somewhere on this plate. By our estimates, there should be an underground dock here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#14$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing more concrete?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll leave it up to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've got a little time before old Wellington and General Nachzehrer start testing each other's strength, but a little's all you've got.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm trusting you all to wrap this up in a satisfactory way. For me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "And don't forget. This is a trade, Your Royal Highness Alexandrina, and you, Doctor of Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
